<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Global Industries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Global Industries cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it cut its rating on Global Industries to hold from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Expects the stock to move higher from its current level, but at a much slower rate than seen previously.</p>
<p>-- Cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.79 a share form $0.84 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cut the 1998 estimate to $0.96 a share from $1.07 share.</p>
<p>-- Global Industries dropped 7/8 to 23-7/8 in late afternoon exchange trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
